	"Description": "Equipment lying in the world (M11 G2): AGSTN_EquipmentPickup with a typed payload (a whole kit, a support weapon; other plugins register their own), the kit pickup and its swap, the kit drop hook, and the race rule for two players on one pickup (earliest request frame, then lower player id). Server-authoritative actors; the change reaches the simulation as a new loadout revision, never predicted.",
